#### **Simplified Logic**
```java
public static String countBidirectional(int[][] nArray) {
    int count = 0;
    for (int i = 0; i < nArray.length; i++) {
        for (int j = i + 1; j < nArray.length; j++) {
            if (nArray[j][0] == nArray[i][1] && nArray[i][1] == nArray[j][0]) {
                count++;
            }
        }
    }
    return String.valueOf(count);
}
```

